    <decisions>
        <description>Verify the state of Forecast Billing Date.
If the Forecast Billing Date is in the Past based on Current Month : Past Outcome is Executed and Actual Billing Value is added to Var_Outlook_Total variable. Past having delay reason conditions which allows in forecast total is None or Internal - Billing in Research.
If the Forecast Billing Date is in the Current Year and Current Month and has Actual Billings : Current Outcome is Executed where Actual Billings is added to Var_Outlook_Total variable. Current having delay reasons which allows in forecast total is None or Internal - Billing in Research.
If the Forecast Billing Date is in Future or Actual Billings is not available for Current Month&apos;s SBF Line: Future is Executed where Update Billing Outlook is added to Var_Outlook_Total variable. Future don&apos;t have any delay reason conditions, it allows all the delay reasons or None.</description>
        <name>Check_SBF_date</name>
        <label>Check SBF date</label>
        <locationX>1628</locationX>
        <locationY>1082</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Loop_Through_Opp_Related_SBFs</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Default Outcome</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Past</name>
            <conditionLogic>((1 AND 4 AND 7) OR (2 AND 3 AND 4 AND 7)) OR ((1 AND 5 AND 6 AND 7) OR (2 AND 3 AND 5 AND 6 AND 7))</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Year_Of_ForecastBillingDate</leftValueReference>
                <operator>LessThan</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <elementReference>Var_CurrentYear</elementReference>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Year_Of_ForecastBillingDate</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <elementReference>Var_CurrentYear</elementReference>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Month_of_ForecastBillingDate</leftValueReference>
                <operator>LessThan</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <elementReference>Var_CurrentMonth</elementReference>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Loop_Through_Opp_Related_SBFs.Delay_Reasons_B2B_Billing_Outlook__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Loop_Through_Opp_Related_SBFs.Delay_Reasons_B2B_Billing_Outlook__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Loop_Through_Opp_Related_SBFs.Delay_Reasons_B2B_Billing_Outlook__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Internal - Billing in Research</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Loop_Through_Opp_Related_SBFs.Actual_Billings__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>GreaterThan</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <numberValue>0.0</numberValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Actual_Billing_has_a_Value_in_Past_SBF_Lines</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Past</label>
        </rules>
        <rules>
            <name>Current</name>
            <conditionLogic>(1 AND 2 AND 3 AND 4) OR (1 AND 2 AND 3 AND 5 AND 6)</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Loop_Through_Opp_Related_SBFs.Actual_Billings__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>GreaterThan</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <numberValue>0.0</numberValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Year_Of_ForecastBillingDate</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <elementReference>Var_CurrentYear</elementReference>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Month_of_ForecastBillingDate</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <elementReference>Var_CurrentMonth</elementReference>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Loop_Through_Opp_Related_SBFs.Delay_Reasons_B2B_Billing_Outlook__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Loop_Through_Opp_Related_SBFs.Delay_Reasons_B2B_Billing_Outlook__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Loop_Through_Opp_Related_SBFs.Delay_Reasons_B2B_Billing_Outlook__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Internal - Billing in Research</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Actual_Billing_has_a_value_in_Current_SBF_Line</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Current</label>
        </rules>
        <rules>
            <name>Future_Current_Past_Updated_Billing_Outlook</name>
            <conditionLogic>(1 OR (2 AND 3)) OR (2 AND 4 AND 5) OR ((6 AND 5) OR (2 AND 7 AND 5)) OR (8 AND 2 AND 4 AND 9) OR ((8 AND 6 AND 9) OR (8 AND 2 AND 7 AND 9))</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Year_Of_ForecastBillingDate</leftValueReference>
                <operator>GreaterThan</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <elementReference>Var_CurrentYear</elementReference>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Year_Of_ForecastBillingDate</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <elementReference>Var_CurrentYear</elementReference>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Month_of_ForecastBillingDate</leftValueReference>
                <operator>GreaterThan</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <elementReference>Var_CurrentMonth</elementReference>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Month_of_ForecastBillingDate</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <elementReference>Var_CurrentMonth</elementReference>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Loop_Through_Opp_Related_SBFs.Delay_Reasons_B2B_Billing_Outlook__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Year_Of_ForecastBillingDate</leftValueReference>
                <operator>LessThan</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <elementReference>Var_CurrentYear</elementReference>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Month_of_ForecastBillingDate</leftValueReference>
                <operator>LessThan</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <elementReference>Var_CurrentMonth</elementReference>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Loop_Through_Opp_Related_SBFs.Delay_Reasons_B2B_Billing_Outlook__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Loop_Through_Opp_Related_SBFs.Delay_Reasons_B2B_Billing_Outlook__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Internal - Billing in Research</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Update_Billing_Outlook_in_Future_SBF_lines_or_in_Current_SBF_lines</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Future / Current / Past_Updated_Billing_Outlook</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>Story #15080 : Outlook Total = Sum of the lines (Per line, bring in; Past month&apos;s Actual Billings OR Updated Billing Outlook if Actual Billings = 0 OR null if Actual Billings = 0 &amp; has Delayed Reason + Current month&apos;s Actual Billings OR Updated Billing Outlook if Actual Billings = 0 OR null if Actual Billings = 0 &amp; has Delayed Reason + all future month&apos;s Updated Billing Outlook)

This is a common flow for updating Outlook Total field on Opportunity.  Calculate Outlook Total, based on Updated Billing Outlook, Actual Billing and Delay Reason  form related Sales Billing Forecast Object records.

#20469: Updated Outlook Total field logic:
Outlook Total (Forecast Total)= Sum of the lines (Per line, bring in Past lines Actual Billing,
                                                                                 Current line&apos;s Actual Billing or Updated Billing Outlook
                                                                                 Future line&apos;s Updated Billing Outlook)
Past/ Current / Future is decided based on Current Month and not Date.

#28560 - Updated Outlook Total logic
Outlook Total (Forecast Total)= Sum of the lines (Per line, bring in Past lines Actual Billing or Updated Billing Outlook,
                                                                                 Current line&apos;s Actual Billing or Updated Billing Outlook
                                                                                 Future line&apos;s Updated Billing Outlook)
Including in Outlook Total, that have a delay reason EXCEPT when the delay reason = &apos;Internal Billing Research&apos;</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
